{"symbol":"GKP","yahoo":"GKP.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"G. K. P. Printing & Packaging Limited","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Packaging & Containers","website":"https://www.gkpl.in","about":"G. K. P. Printing & Packaging Limited manufactures and sells corrugated boxes in India. The company offers coloured, customized, printed, and white corrugated boxes, as well as corrugated packaging boxes, corrugated paper boxes, and corrugated boxes with partition. It also trades in kraft paper, duplex paper, and low-density plastic rolls. The company serves the liquor, garment exports, retail, steel utensils, pharmaceuticals, playing cards, prints, record management, engineering, confectionery, and FMGC sectors. It exports its products. G. K. P. Printing & Packaging Limited was founded in 1994 and is based in Palghar, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:24:38+00:00","quote":{"price":7.4,"prevClose":7.4,"marketCap":16.28,"high52":10.36,"low52":5.03,"pe":67.27,"bookValue":11.78,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":null,"shares":2.1999,"insiders":52.96,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2019-05-08","2019-05-09","2019-05-10","2019-05-13","2019-05-14","2019-05-15","2019-05-16","2019-05-17","2019-05-20","2019-05-21","2019-05-22","2019-05-23","2019-05-24","2019-05-27","2019-05-28","2019-05-29","2019-05-30","2019-05-31","2019-06-03","2019-06-04","2019-06-06","2019-06-07","2019-06-10","2019-06-11","2019-06-12","2019-06-13","2019-06-14","2019-06-17","2019-06-18","2019-06-19","2019-06-20","2019-06-21","2019-06-24","2019-06-25","2019-06-26","2019-06-27","2019-06-28","2019-07-01","2019-07-02","2019-07-03","2019-07-04","2019-07-05","2019-07-08","2019-07-09","2019-07-10","2019-07-11","2019-07-12","2019-07-15","2019-07-16","2019-07-17","2019-07-18","2019-07-19","2019-07-22","2019-07-23","2019-07-24","2019-07-25","2019-07-26","2019-07-29","2019-07-30","2019-07-31","2019-08-01","2019-08-02","2019-08-05","2019-08-06","2019-08-07","2019-08-08","2019-08-09","2019-08-13","2019-08-14","2019-0